o evidence yet. Reviewed records will distinguish completion, independent understanding, findings, limitations and proposed versus verified controls. No flags, answers, secrets or spoilers will be published.</p></section><section><h2>Final reflection</h2><p>Pending the event. The final review will reconcile results, skills, gaps, Security+ mapping and follow-up labs. No credential or completed work is claimed.</p></section></div><aside class="dossier-aside"><h2>Evidence status</h2><span class="pill planned">Planned</span><p>0/24 recorded; independent understanding not assessed.</p><div class="divider"></div><h3>Next checkpoint</h3><p>1 December: first released challenge.</p><a class="text-link" href="../../en/roadmap/index.html#aoc2026">View learning roadmap</a></aside></div></div></main><noscript><p class="shell">All content is available without JavaScript. JavaScript enables the interactive search and filters.</p></noscript><footer id="footer"><div class="shell footer"><span>© Jeroen · Security Engineering · Manually reviewed public portfolio content</span><div><a href="../methodology/index.html">Methodology &amp; evidence</a><span aria-hidden="true"> · </span><a href="../../en/roadmap/index.html">Learning roadmap</a><span aria-hidden="true"> · </span><a href="../../en/contact/index.html">Contact</a></div></div></footer><script defer="" src="../../assets/dashboard.js"></script></body></html>